{"format":1,"key":"item:a-faded-journal-page","path":"/lore/item/a-faded-journal-page","name":"A Faded Journal Page","kind":"item","label":"Item","zone":{"key":"duskwood","name":"Duskwood","path":"/lore/zone/duskwood"},"levels":"","description":"In eastern Elwynn, an old page points toward Stalvan Mistmantle's grim history.","intro":[],"clips":[{"id":"item:a-faded-journal-page","part":"narration","anchor":"story","title":"The story","paras":["In eastern Elwynn, an old page points toward Stalvan Mistmantle's grim history.","The Faded Journal Page lay for years in an old trunk at Marshal Haggard's home near Elwynn Forest's eastern border. Haggard had retired there, but his failing eyesight kept him from reading the weathered parchment. The page stayed neglected until investigators seeking the truth about Stalvan Mistmantle retrieved it."],"hash":"4f45e7","voices":{"male-narrator":{"sha":"c25f649a47","sec":21},"female-narrator":{"sha":"ef8e33bd12","sec":24}}}],"sources":[{"kind":"wiki","title":"A Faded Journal Page","url":"https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/A_Faded_Journal_Page"},{"kind":"wiki","title":"The Legend of Stalvan (8)","url":"https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/The_Legend_of_Stalvan_(8)"},{"kind":"wiki","title":"The Legend of Stalvan (9)","url":"https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/The_Legend_of_Stalvan_(9)"}],"related":[{"p":"/lore/quest/66-the-legend-of-stalvan","n":"The Legend of Stalvan","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/quest/1666-marshal-haggard","n":"Marshal Haggard","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/npc/tavernkeep-smitts","n":"Tavernkeep Smitts","k":"npc"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/scarlet-raven-tavern","n":"Scarlet Raven Tavern","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/zone/elwynn","n":"Elwynn Forest","k":"zone"},{"p":"/lore/zone/duskwood","n":"Duskwood","k":"zone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/darkshire","n":"Darkshire","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/quest/75-the-legend-of-stalvan","n":"The Legend of Stalvan","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/quest/78-the-legend-of-stalvan","n":"The Legend of Stalvan","k":"quest"}],"wowhead"